@startuml sequence

title Main Flow: PDF Text Extraction\n(Happy Path and Error Path)
actor "User" as U
participant "Web Interface\n(Frontend)" as FW
participant "API\n(FastAPI Controller)" as API
participant "Document\nService" as SD
participant "PDF Service" as SP
participant "Checksum\nService" as SC
participant "MongoDB\nRepository" as DB
== Happy Path: Successful Processing ==
U -> FW : Selects/drags PDF file
FW -> FW : Validate MIME type,\n.pdf extension and size (10MB)
FW -> API : POST /api/v1/documents/\nFormData {file}
API -> API : validate_pdf_file()\n(content_type and extension)
API -> API : Read bytes into memory\n(file.read())
API -> API : Validate max size\nconfigured (max_pdf_size_mb)
API -> SD : process_and_save(file_bytes, filename)
SD -> SP : process_pdf(file_bytes, filename)
SP -> SP : Calculate SHA-256 checksum\n(hashlib.sha256)
SP -> SP : Extract text with PdfReader\n(iterate pages)
SP --> SD : PdfProcessingResult\n{checksum, extracted_text, page_dimensions}
SD -> SC : validate_and_create_document(\nDocumentCreateDTO)
SC -> SC : calculate_checksum(file_bytes)
SC -> DB : find_by_checksum(checksum)
DB --> SC : None (does not exist)
SC -> SC : Create Document entity\n{checksum, text, date}
SC --> SD : ChecksumValidationResult\n{is_valid=True, document}
SD -> DB : save(document)
DB --> SD : document_id
SD --> API : ChecksumValidationResult\n{is_valid=True, document}
API -> API : DocumentResponseDTO\n.from_entity(document)
API --> FW : HTTP 200 JSON\n{id, checksum, extracted_text, created_at}
FW -> FW : Calculate SHA-256 locally\n(Web Crypto API)
FW -> FW : Display results:\nchecksum and extracted text
FW --> U : Shows SHA-256 checksum\nand extracted text
== Error Path: Invalid Format ==
U -> FW : Selects non-PDF file\n(e.g: image.png)
FW -> FW : Validate MIME type\nand extension -> fails
FW --> U : Shows error:\n"File must be a PDF.\nInvalid format."
== Error Path: Corrupted PDF ==
U -> FW : Selects corrupted PDF
FW -> API : POST /api/v1/documents/\nFormData {file}
API -> API : validate_pdf_file() -> OK
API -> API : Read bytes into memory -> OK
API -> SD : process_and_save(file_bytes, filename)
SD -> SP : process_pdf(file_bytes, filename)
SP -> SP : PdfReader raises PdfReadError
SP --> SD : PdfProcessingError\n"Corrupted or unreadable PDF"
SD --> API : DocumentServiceError
API --> FW : HTTP 422\n"Could not process PDF"
FW --> U : Shows error:\n"File is not a valid PDF\nor is corrupted."
== Error Path: Duplicate Document ==
U -> FW : Uploads existing PDF
FW -> API : POST /api/v1/documents/\nFormData {file}
API -> API : validate_pdf_file() -> OK
API -> SD : process_and_save(file_bytes, filename)
SD -> SP : process_pdf(file_bytes, filename)
SP --> SD : PdfProcessingResult
SD -> SC : validate_and_create_document(dto)
SC -> SC : calculate_checksum(file_bytes)
SC -> DB : find_by_checksum(checksum)
DB --> SC : Existing document
SC --> SD : ChecksumValidationResult\n{is_valid=False,\nerror_message="already exists"}
SD --> API : ChecksumValidationResult\n{is_valid=False}
API --> FW : HTTP 409 Conflict\n"Document with checksum already exists"
FW --> U : Shows error:\n"File already exists in system."
@enduml
